Pasal 17

(1) Penyediaan pelayanan perlindungan perempuan sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 16 hurrf e berupa identifikasi korban, bantuan hukum, rehabilitasi medis, rehabilitasi psikososial, reintegrasi sosial, bantuan pemulangan, atau bentuk lainnya.

(2) Penyediaan pelayanan perlindungan perempuan dimaksud pada ayat (1) diberikan bagi perempuan a. korban kekerasan;

b. korban perdagangan orang;

c. daerah rawan konflik dan bencana;

d. pekerja;

e. lanjut usia;

f. disabilitas;

g. korban eksploitasi seksual;

h. kepala keluarga; dan i.kelompok rentan lainnya.

translated_text:
Article 17

(1) The provision of women's protection services as referred to in Article 16 letter e consists of victim identification, legal assistance, medical rehabilitation, psychosocial rehabilitation, social reintegration, repatriation assistance, or other forms.

(2) The provision of women's protection services referred to in paragraph (1) is provided for women a. victims of violence;

b. victims of human trafficking;

c. areas prone to conflict and disaster;

d. workers;

e. elderly;

f. disabilities;

g. victims of sexual exploitation;

h. heads of households; and i. other vulnerable groups.
